### 说明：先执行 login.http 拿到 {{token}}

### 1. 普通问答（一次性返回）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "用一句话解释什么是数据库索引"
}

### 2. 普通问答（流式 SSE，事件：session / delta / done / error）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/chat/stream
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "message": "用三句话介绍 B+ 树"
}

### 3. 基于资料提问（RAG，事件：session / sources / delta / done）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/ai/rag/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "question": "索引为什么会变慢？"
}

### 4. AI 生成学习计划（会自动拆解为每日任务）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/plans/generate
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "goal": "掌握数据库索引",
  "currentLevel": "了解 SQL 基础",
  "startDate": "2026-10-16",
  "endDate": "2026-10-25",
  "dailyMinutes": 90,
  "availableDays": ["周一", "周二", "周三", "周四", "周五"]
}

### 5. AI 学习复盘报告
GET http://localhost:8080/api/statistics/report?days=7
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
